    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltwELcYaV88twxhbpErPIYTcltmr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本集内容｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本集节目分享一下克师傅最近参加香港大学冥想的体验。我们来聊聊什么是禅修？是一群人盘腿坐着呼吸吗？以及禅修是当代年轻人“躺平”、逃避现实焦虑的优解吗？如果你还没有看过等发干第六集，关于禅修的预热篇，请先去看一下那一集～</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期节目我们继续来讨论一下关于禅修的这个话题：传统的禅修和正念冥想课程有什么样的异同？有没有一种可能，禅修其实也很科学！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后别忘了订阅等发干的节目，也欢迎留言互动你的感受和故事，感谢收听和关注！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜时间轴｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 本期节目介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 参加禅修营&amp;报名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 什么是禅修</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 参加完的个人感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="873">14:33</a> 我的禅修日记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 修空观后我停止了内耗和焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 给大脑开“后门”的比喻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a> 我的禅修经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a> 禅修是年轻人躺平逃避现实焦虑的优解吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 寺庙这个空间自带的疗愈场域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> 寺庙作为一个缓冲的“休息站”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">42:53</a> 下期节目预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a> 本集歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 歌曲放送时间🎵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜BGM｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>春日小径花园-Furyl</span></p>]]></description>
