  <item>
    <title>4｜我的潜水生死奇遇：站在生命边缘的启示</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ebc0b98e6f71a5b7ec86b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ebc0b98e6f71a5b7ec86b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Mar 2024 01:51:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>｜本期内容｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这期等发干来到关于死亡这个主题的最后一集。这期分享了我在一天内出了两次潜水意外后幸存的玄学奇遇，以及站在生命的边缘时，带给我关于生命、爱、恐惧与死亡的启示。祝每位潜水员都能安潜安潜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后别忘了订阅等发干电台节目，也欢迎留言互动你的感受和故事，感谢收听和关注！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜时间轴｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 本集内容&amp;玄学元素预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 当天在水下的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 水下的幻觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 南海观世音菩萨“救”了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 回到陆地后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3164">52:44</a> 生命是脆弱的，展露脆弱是一种能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3495">58:15</a> 启示一：我们是来体验的，而不是趋利避害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3585">59:45</a> 关于水的意象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3876">01:04:36</a> 关于观世音菩萨的意象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4421">01:13:41</a> 启示二：无惧地生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4699">01:18:19</a> 启示三：“如果你不觉得是恩赐，那是因为没走到尽头”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4901">01:21:41</a> 固定歌曲放送环节的缘起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5002">01:23:22</a> 本集歌曲放送🎵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| BGM |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《夏花》- 黔东南侗族原住民 [专辑：乐典侗族（叁）]</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq78LXjKjzKMoiGL3nS_Q7oLO-gm.m4a" length="129316127" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:09</itunes:duration>
