  <item>
    <title>3｜面对亲人离世，我们该如何真正说再见？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65dd829635dd8780ed466b00</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65dd829635dd8780ed466b00</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Feb 2024 06:35:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loW74HVVCPq1SecJeo5c1QLB-P9D.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期内容｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这期等发干来到关于死亡这个主题的第二集，从心理学和个人经历的角度来聊聊面对亲人离世的痛苦，我们该如何真正说再见。最后别忘了订阅等发干电台节目，也欢迎留言互动你的感受、提建议，感谢收听和关注！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜时间轴｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 本集内容简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 亲人离世是怎样的感觉呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 最痛苦的不是死亡这个事实到来的那一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 参加亲人葬礼上的一件小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> 面对死亡，我们永远不会完全准备好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 面对最近有亲人离世的朋友，我们该如何陪伴/帮助朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 亲人离世后，我们能为他们做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 自己如何从亲人离世的悲痛中走出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> 觉察情绪——情绪日记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 容许身体的正常反应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 让未完成完成——给离世的亲人写信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> 不要避讳不断地提起Ta</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a> 关于死亡和生命的启示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a> 如何减轻对死亡的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 为什么亲人离世后有一个巨大的空洞？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 对待这个空洞，如何应对？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 请不要在我的墓前哭泣，我并没有离去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> 结语（本集放送歌曲欣赏）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜BGM｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Gael Garcia Bernal - Remember Me (Lullaby) (From ＂Coco＂／Soundtrack Version)</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll7q5Lof0P_DHBJmTU7xwpFG7kNR.m4a" length="51954175" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:49</itunes:duration>
